
 ✗  No API token found

    pt authenticates with an API token from a .pipetower file (JSON) with one or more environments.

    Looked in $PIPETOWER_URL / $PIPETOWER_TOKEN, $PIPETOWER_CONFIG and:
      ~/.pipetower
      /nonexistent/.pipetower
      /.pipetower

    Create a token   <your Pipetower URL>/account  →  API tokens
    Save it          pt env add

